{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段影片，一輛銀色7人車在車來車往的彌敦道路中心時突然停下接載乘客，期間更在車門未關好的情況下急急駛走。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-12h36m10s975.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026fBULsWjdTK1787805749.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-12h36m10s975.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段顯示，事發地點為繁忙的旺角彌敦道。當時該輛銀色 7 人車於路中心突然停下，隨後有2名乘客橫越1條行車線上車。期間後方車輛見狀多次響咹催促，惟乘客尚未完全上車、車門亦未關好，7 人車司機便急忙踩油駛走，過程十分危險。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-12h36m15s568.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026zj7jPkpEb81787805765.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-27-12h36m15s568.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片曝光後迅速引發網民熱議，大批網民紛紛批評 7 人車司機及乘客的行為極度危險且不負責任，留言嘲諷：「雙黃唔停得，咁我唔停雙黃咪ok」、「路中間上車，仲要慢吞吞」，亦有網民指責相關駕駛態度，呼籲向當局舉報：「有無 1823？」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-27T04:58:46.526253+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":283,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}